  "version": 1,
  "title": "OEIS A371710: Hanna's mod-3 pattern",
  "abstract": "The e.g.f. A(x) = Σ a(n)xⁿ/n! of OEIS A371710 satisfies Σ_{n≥0} (A(x)^n − x)^n/n! = 1. The package proves that exactly one A ∈ ℚ[[x]] does, that A(0) = 0 and every a(n) is an integer, and Paul D. Hanna's 2024 conjecture that a(6n + k) ≡ [2, 0, 2, 1, 2, 2](k) (mod 3) for n > 0 and k = 0, …, 5. It also proves the stronger pattern a(m) ≡ 2 for even m ≥ 2 and a(m) ≡ 1 − m for odd m ≥ 3, modulo 3.",
